   7               SKON=6000               /SKIP IF INTERRUPT ON AND TURN INTERRUPT OFF
   8               SRQ=6003                /SKIP IF INTERRUPT REQUEST
   9               GTF=6004                /GET INTERRUPT FLAGS
  10               RTF=6005                /RESTORE INTERRUPT FLAGS AND TURN INTERRUPT ON
